<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia's RAMS to issue Series 3 bonds in Q3.</title>
<headline>Australia's RAMS to issue Series 3 bonds in Q3.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Non-bank mortgage originator RAMS Mortgage Corp is expected to issue the first of its Series 3 mortgage-backed securities in third quarter 1997, Australian Securitised Funding (ASF) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Announcing the latest pricing of the fifth and final tranche of RAMS Series 2 bonds, ASF, a securitisation specialist responsible for refinancing RAMS' residential mortgages, said that it is in the process of structuring the next series in cooperation with placement agents.</p>
</text>
